<title>USA: U.S. DAP, ammonia prices unchanged.</title>
<headline>U.S. DAP, ammonia prices unchanged.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. cash diammonium phosphate and ammonia prices were mixed in quiet activity Friday. A recent purchase by China firmed up the export market, trade sources said.</p>
<p>			   Dlrs/short ton	  Chg from Wednesday</p>
<p>DAP central Fla	   174-176			unc</p>
<p>DAP central La Gulf     182-184			up 2/up 1</p>
<p>Ammonia/La Gulf		 225			unc</p>
<p>--(Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720)</p>
